    "detailed_description": "Wurmus is a non-traditional snake-like which rewards creative movement, spatial awareness, and risk management. It's best experienced with a gamepad and headphones.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A different breed of Snake</h2>Outrun, outsmart, and eat your opponents. Move backwards, strafe sideways, and turn freely. Collect power-ups which taunt, instill fear, and grant stability.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your high score</h2>Earn points for captures and longevity. Purposely lose encounters\u2014and manage the ensuing chaos\u2014to pad your highest score yet.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An accessible experience</h2>Wurmus provides high visual contrast, binaural audio cues, and screen reader support. Its graphics can be toggled off to be enjoyed with audio alone.",
